{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Start executions with the function's DurableConfig**\n\nEvery initial invocation receives a 300-second timeout and seven-day retention even when its SAM `DurableConfig` differs; the runner directly uses the supplied timeout to schedule execution expiry. Timeout examples therefore run under different semantics from their cloud deployment. Pass the selected function's `ExecutionTimeout` and `RetentionPeriodInDays` to the proxy and test non-default values.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM73MNYW","finding_digest":"3901a83f925861e8a4e06d78866d6507d91266662ca41e34291273ca3b00e545","finding_id":"arf_v1_hea2qp4slbq6rjhanv4im3lfa7","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::start_execution::template-durable-config-ignored","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::start_execution::template-durable-config-ignored","line":109,"observation_digest":"1e539d30db95c3781e23c8090df6f30da234d14f6f8fff352a3cc997e6e7044e","observation_id":"aro_v1_dzjz2mg3sxbxqhrdzaeq35xtbw","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-30T16:59:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bnud5kfbfetmz3d5g5dgf7e6t7","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"ecfaf35d145fe615c797dce03e042eb26cc007fc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":108,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_7vahj6h2fa26adrxacu5a4flaj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:59:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
